6Qwipw":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Product Description","content":"","liquid":"{{product.description}}","default_open":false}},"collapsible_tab_K9bxt9":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Wash care","content":"<p>To keep your child’s favorite graphic t-shirt looking vibrant and feeling comfortable, follow these simple care tips:<\/p><p>1. <strong>Wash with care:<\/strong> Turn the t-shirt inside out to protect the design and machine wash in cold water.<\/p><p>2. <strong>Gentle detergents:<\/strong> Use mild detergent and avoid harsh chemicals, bleach, or fabric softeners to preserve the fabric and colors.<\/p><p>3. <strong>Drying:<\/strong> For best results, air dry the t-shirt flat or hang it up. If you prefer machine drying, use a low-heat setting to prevent shrinking.<\/p><p>4. <strong>Ironing:<\/strong> If needed, iron on a low setting. Don't iron directly on the graphic print; turn the t-shirt inside out or use a protective cloth.<\/p><p>5. <strong>Storage:<\/strong> Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight to avoid fading over time.<\/p><p>By following these tips, you’ll ensure the t-shirt stays soft, colorful, and ready for all your little one's adventures!<\/p>","liquid":"","default_open":false}},"collapsible_tab_JJDNcc":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Exchange and Return","content":"<p>We want you to be happy with your purchase! <\/p><p><strong>Exchange:<br\/><\/strong>If the size isn’t quite right, we offer a 7-day exchange period. You can exchange your item for the same product in a different size within 7 days of receiving it.<\/p><p><strong>Return: <br\/><\/strong>For returns, we provide neOwn store credit equivalent to the item’s value, which can be used for future purchases. Please note that we do not currently offer monetary refunds.<\/p><p><em>To initiate an exchange or return, contact us on WhatsApp at +91 9137081640 with your order number and the desired size for exchange.<\/em><\/p>